w04nJVWZL2YZiREakAyk93-q6OV6lEdXLpYGVhCMzg&oe=6A8580C8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LandScape.png", "id": "4526900444203911", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_4526900447537244_1593155788570280980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EZXm5OW1omUQ7kNvwHZI9_q&_nc_oc=AdqdY--wD-cJge0RN6Na121Kr2D_9JIxV3xGA4yujBkHA7KfmFaKP3pBqYnkOJZDgys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFcmI2YN-THogtp-sTUgxAkL5IghuJNcaRSrfCm3DViVA&oe=6A85AFE6"}, "display_name": "The Historical Art Gallery", "keywords": ["AI", "Gallery", "Art", "Paintings", "History"], "long_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings.", "short_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-updated-at-2021-09-17.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreatio